:: Science Fair Avery
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>>

<<if $phase is 1>>
	You take Avery's arm and leave the town hall.
	<<if $averyragerevealed gte 1>>
		<<if $science_leighton_flirt>>
			"You ought to be careful around Leighton in the future," <<he>> says while driving. <<He>> doesn't sound upset, but you notice <<his>> grip tighten on the steering wheel. You had no idea <<he>> had been watching you for that long.<<npcincr Avery love 1>><<npcincr Avery rage -1>><<glove>><<larage>>
			<br><br>
		<<elseif $science_sabotage>>
			"You ought to be certain you will succeed before attempting such risky moves," <<he>> says while driving. "I'm referring to your fellow student's display." You had no idea <<he>> had been watching you for that long.<<npcincr Avery love 1>><<npcincr Avery rage -1>><<glove>><<larage>>
			<br><br>
		<<elseif ($science_fair_project is "lichen" and $sciencelichenchance lt 100) or ($science_fair_project is "shroom" and $scienceshroomchance lt 100) or ($science_fair_project is "phallus" and $sciencephalluschance lt 100)>>
			"It's good that you won," <<he>> says while driving. "But you ought to spend a little more time and effort on presentations like these."<<npcincr Avery love 1>><<npcincr Avery rage -1>><<glove>><<larage>>
			<br><br>
		<<else>>
			"You did well," <<he>> says while driving. "I expect similar showings in the future."<<npcincr Avery love 1>><<npcincr Avery rage -1>><<glove>><<larage>>
			<br><br>
		<</if>>
	<<else>>
		<<He>> praises you for your showing while <<he>> drives.<<npcincr Avery love 1>><<npcincr Avery rage -1>><<glove>><<larage>>
		<br><br>
	<</if>>

	<<scienceprojectfinish>>

	<<if Time.weekDay is 7 and $averydate is 1 and Time.hour is 20 and $averydatedone isnot 1>>
		<<if $worn.upper.type.includes("formal") and $worn.lower.type.includes("formal")>>
			Since you're already dressed for your date, <<he>> forgoes stopping at the mansion.
			<br><br>
			<<avery_date_options>>
		<<else>>
			You soon arrive at the mansion. <<He>> opens your door for you. "Go get changed into something <span class="gold">formal</span>," <<he>> says. "Then we can go <<= $avery_location is 3 ? `to dinner` : $avery_location is 1 ? `to our party` : $avery_location is 2 ? `to the hotel` : `to Bailey's`>>."
			<br><br>
			<<link [[Next|Mansion Garage]]>><<set $avery_mansion.date_ready to true>><<endevent>><</link>>
		<</if>>
	<<else>>
		You soon arrive at the mansion. <<He>> opens your door for you, and both of you head inside.
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Next|Mansion Garage]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<<scienceprojectfinish>>
	<<endevent>><<npc Avery>><<person1>>

	Avery frowns, and drops <<his>> arm with a <<= C.npc.Avery.rage gte 60 ? `scoff` : C.npc.Avery.rage gte 20 ? `curt sigh` : `sigh`>>. "Very well. I'll see you <<= $averydate is 1 and $averydatedone isnot 1 ? `later tonight` : `another time`>>, then.<<if $averydate is 1 and Time.hour is 20 and $averydatedone isnot 1>><<set $averydatedone to 1>> I'll be waiting in the garage. Don't keep me waiting too long.<</if>>" <<npcincr Avery love -1>><<garage>>
	<br><br>
	With that, <<he>> leaves.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Cliff Street]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>


:: Science Fair Watch
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>>

You walk among the students and examine their projects. Some are more impressive than others. One is just an essay taped to a board. Another looks more like an art project.
<br><br>

The public are allowed in. They roam between the displays, asking questions and flirting inappropriately with students.
<br><br>

Leighton walks on stage and taps the microphone. Sirris stands beside <<him>>. "Thank you, <<if maleChance() is 100>>boys and gentlemen<<elseif maleChance() is 0>>girls and ladies<<else>>boys and girls, ladies and gentlemen<</if>>, for coming," <<he>> says. "I've seen some fine work already. Sirris and I will judge. Be patient."
<br><br>

Leighton and Sirris leave the stage and begin to circle around the room. Leighton criticises the projects. Sirris observes, but gives words of encouragement if Leighton was particularly scathing. Still, some students are left tearful by the headteacher's remarks.
<br><br>

After conferring they announce that a <<person2>><<person>> with a flower display is the winner.
<br><br>

Leighton herds you and the other students from the hall. You might have learned something.
<<gscience>><<scienceskill 6>>
<br><br>

<<set $scienceproject to "done">>


<<link [[Next|Cliff Street]]>><<scienceprojectfinish>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
<br>
